### Data Sync: upsert a refund policy into vector space "policy"
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/ai/data-sync/upsert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vectorSpace": "policy",
  "id": "policy-1",
  "entity": {
    "title": "Refund Policy",
    "text": "Returns accepted within 30 days of delivery with receipt. Items must be in original condition. Refunds issued to original payment method within 5-10 business days after inspection.",
    "classification": "refund"
  },
  "trace": {
    "requestId": "seed-3",
    "metadata": { "source": "manual-demo", "operation": "policy-upsert" },
    "authContext": {
      "subjectId": "system:platform-ecommerce-store",
      "subjectType": "SYSTEM_PROCESS",
      "authMode": "PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED",
      "callerType": "SYSTEM_PROCESS",
      "sessionId": "seed-session",
      "deploymentId": "ecommerce-store-local",
      "customerId": "demo-commerce-customer",
      "tenantId": "demo-commerce-tenant",
      "issuer": "platform-ecommerce-store",
      "grantedScopes": ["data-sync:upsert", "data-sync:delete"]
    }
  }
}

### Data Sync: upsert a review into vector space "review"
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/ai/data-sync/upsert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vectorSpace": "review",
  "id": "review-1",
  "entity": {
    "userId": "{{userId}}",
    "sku": "SKU-0001",
    "rating": 4,
    "text": "Great sound and ANC. Very comfortable for long flights."
  },
  "trace": {
    "requestId": "seed-4",
    "metadata": { "source": "manual-demo", "operation": "review-upsert" },
    "authContext": {
      "subjectId": "system:platform-ecommerce-store",
      "subjectType": "SYSTEM_PROCESS",
      "authMode": "PRIVATE_RUNTIME_BACKEND_MEDIATED",
      "callerType": "SYSTEM_PROCESS",
      "sessionId": "seed-session",
      "deploymentId": "ecommerce-store-local",
      "customerId": "demo-commerce-customer",
      "tenantId": "demo-commerce-tenant",
      "issuer": "platform-ecommerce-store",
      "grantedScopes": ["data-sync:upsert", "data-sync:delete"]
    }
  }
}

### Chat: RAG + actions (catalog recommendation)
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "position": "landing",
  "query": "I'm looking for wireless headphones under $250. Recommend options from the catalog and explain briefly."
}

### Chat: policy lookup (executor mode)
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "mode": "executor",
  "query": "What is the refund policy?"
}

### Chat: action using attachment (deterministic target resolution)
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "position": "cart",
  "query": "Add it to my cart",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "id": "SKU-0001",
      "vectorSpace": "product",
      "contentText": "Premium Wireless Headphones",
      "metadata": { "sku": "SKU-0001", "category": "Headphones" },
      "source": "ui-card"
    }
  ]
}

### Chat: confirm (when the runtime asks for confirmation for a write action)
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}",
  "position": "cart",
  "query": "Yes, confirm"
}

### Chat: suggestions (UI helper)
POST {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/chat/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "content": "I want to buy headphones",
  "maxSuggestions": 5
}

### Conversations (runtime persistence)
GET {{runtimeBaseUrl}}/api/chat/conversations?ownerId={{userId}}
